WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.100
a man is now walking more than a decade after&nbsp;
suffering a paralyzing spinal cord injury 40&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:05.100 --> 00:00:10.140
year old janoskim was injured in a motorcycle&nbsp;
accident more than a decade ago it prevented&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:10.140 --> 00:00:14.340
him from taking a single step but now doctors in&nbsp;
Switzerland have helped him regain his ability&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:14.340 --> 00:00:24.660
to walk through his thoughts they put implants in&nbsp;
my brain and in my back to to learn to walk again&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:26.340 --> 00:00:31.800
amazing here's how it works the implants&nbsp;
in the brain track intentions for movements&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:31.800 --> 00:00:36.300
right what he's thinking about moving those&nbsp;
are wirelessly transferred to a processing&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:36.300 --> 00:00:40.680
unit that a person wears externally like&nbsp;
a backpack you saw him wearing it there he&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:40.680 --> 00:00:44.760
says he can now walk about the length&nbsp;
of a football field and stand without&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:44.760 --> 00:00:49.200
using his hands for a few minutes he's even&nbsp;
attempting to get up and down stairs on his own

